{"title":"Dune Raider","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 23 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-raider\" data-map-level=\"22\">Show level 22 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/cdfab9ec86790fb6425d.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 13 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 13 looted corpses, 45 recorded drops, 1,717 total, 12–120 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/13</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 23% of 13 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 19 total, 4–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">23% · 3/13</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 15% of 13 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 10 total, 4–6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">15% · 2/13</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"oak-bow\" title=\"Oak Bow - in 15% of 13 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/16f9769f3f377fd95bd6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Oak Bow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">15% · 2/13</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 2 of 2</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+7 more\">+7 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dune-trousers\" title=\"Dune Trousers - in 8% of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/fffa2aecda46a2368fcc.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Trousers</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/13</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-firepit\" title=\"Scroll Firepit - in 8% of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Firepit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/13</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 8% of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/13</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sand-striders\" title=\"Sand Striders - in 8% of 13 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/108a0459484c61113c4